                "title": "Zelenskyy's top aide quits after anti-corruption searches of his home",
                "type": "url_citation",
                "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/nov/28/ukraines-anti-corruption-agencies-search-home-zelenskyy-chief-aide-andriy-yermak?utm_source=openai"
